## Kotlin 활용 패턴

### Data Classes & Sealed Classes
```kotlin
// ✅ 이벤트 계층 구조
sealed class StreamEvent {
    abstract val eventId: String
    abstract val timestamp: Instant
    
    data class UserRegistered(
        override val eventId: String,
        override val timestamp: Instant,
        val userId: String,
        val email: String
    ) : StreamEvent()
    
    data class PaymentProcessed(
        override val eventId: String,
        override val timestamp: Instant,
        val userId: String,
        val amount: BigDecimal,
        val currency: String
    ) : StreamEvent()
    
    data class ErrorEvent(
        override val eventId: String,
        override val timestamp: Instant,
        val error: String,
        val originalEvent: Any? = null
    ) : StreamEvent()
}
```

### Extension Functions
```kotlin
// ✅ Java 컬렉션 확장
fun <T> List<T>.chunkedBySize(maxSize: Int): List<List<T>> = 
    chunked(maxSize)

fun <K, V> Map<K, V>.getOrThrow(key: K): V = 
    this[key] ?: throw NoSuchElementException("Key $key not found")

// ✅ KStream 확장
fun <K, V> KStream<K, V>.filterNotNull(): KStream<K, V> = 
    filter { _, value -> value != null }

fun <K, V> KStream<K, V>.logProcessing(tag: String): KStream<K, V> = 
    peek { key, _ -> log.debug("[$tag] Processing key: $key") }
```

### Type-Safe Builders
```kotlin
// ✅ DSL 스타일 설정
class KafkaStreamsConfigBuilder {
    private val properties = mutableMapOf<String, Any>()
    
    fun applicationId(id: String) = apply { properties[StreamsConfig.APPLICATION_ID_CONFIG] = id }
    fun bootstrapServers(servers: String) = apply { properties[StreamsConfig.BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS_CONFIG] = servers }
    fun exactlyOnce() = apply { properties[StreamsConfig.PROCESSING_GUARANTEE_CONFIG] = StreamsConfig.EXACTLY_ONCE_V2 }
    
    fun build(): Properties = Properties().apply { putAll(properties) }
}

// 사용
val streamsConfig = KafkaStreamsConfigBuilder()
    .applicationId("my-streams-app")
    .bootstrapServers("localhost:9092")
    .exactlyOnce()
    .build()
```

